<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36508" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξαγώγ-ιμος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>exportable,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξαγώγιμον ποιεῖν τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lycurg.
					26
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἐξαγώγιμα</span>”
				<i>exports,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					1345b21
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>unsettled, migratory,</i> of people, 
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσ-</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				360.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>for drawing off</i> water, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ ἐ. τῶν ὑδάτων τάφροι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					4.44
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
